    <string name="s512">"Important browser warning and fix for the connection problem (ERR_ADDRESS_UNREACHABLE):"</string>
    <string name="s513">"1. In the browser address bar: type http:// explicitly, not https://, because the server runs locally inside the network without an external SSL certificate. vMix and OBS connect directly and very fast without any warnings."</string>
    <string name="s514">"2. Make sure to choose a Wi-Fi address (usually starts with 192.168 or 10.0) from the list above, and avoid choosing the SIM data address (Cellular)."</string>
    <string name="s515">"3. If the Wi-Fi network isolates devices from each other (AP Isolation), turn on (Mobile Hotspot) on the phone and connect the broadcast computer to it directly, and it will work immediately without problems."</string>
