    <string name="s524">"Hide"</string>
    <string name="s525">"• The IP address always works, but it may change when the router or device restarts (DHCP), breaking saved links."</string>
    <string name="s526">"• The device name stays fixed even if the IP changes — type the name exactly as it opens in your browser now (without .local)."</string>
    <string name="s527">"• Try the name in the browser first: if the control page opens, the name works on your network and can be relied on."</string>
    <string name="s528">"• If the name stops working on a certain network, switch back to IP — the IP link always stays visible as an alternative."</string>
    <string name="s529">"• This setting only changes the displayed and copied links; the broadcast itself and the connection methods do not change."</string>
